	  Poco::DNSSD, either from the manually-built vcpkg_installed tree
	  (with avahi-client/avahi-common) or system CMake config/pkg-config.
	  Backs KYTHIRA_HAS_POCO_DNSSD.

endmenu # Peer Discovery

